  "question": {
    "text": "Drug $X$ becomes ineffective after $50 \\%$ decomposition. The original concentration of drug in a bottle was $16 \\mathrm{mg} / \\mathrm{mL}$ which becomes $4 \\mathrm{mg} / \\mathrm{mL}$ in 12 months. The expiry time of the drug in months is __________$\\qquad$\nAssume that the decomposition of the drug follows first order kinetics.",
