  "solution": {
    "text": "Drug $\\mathrm{X} \\xrightarrow{\\text { 1st order }}$ Product\nInitial concentration of drug $=16 \\mathrm{mg} / \\mathrm{mL}$\nConcentration of drug after 12 months $=4 \\mathrm{mg} / \\mathrm{mL}$\nHalf life of drug = 6 months\nDrug become ineffective after 50\\% decomposition. The expiry time of drug $=6$ months",
